    "description": "Presenting a truly unique 4-unit Victorian, comprised of a charming triplex & a newly built   vacant standalone cottage with large outdoor space. A versatile opportunity for both seasoned & first-time investors with the added benefit of residing in your own space while generating income. 4 distinct units each with unique appeal. 2 units delivered vacant. Both upper-level units offer a testament to Victorian elegance, showcasing original architectural details, dramatic ceilings, period molding, and breathtaking views. While steeped in history, this property has undergone major updates, including a brand new foundation & a lower level unit with fresh & modern finishes. The vacant, standalone 2BD/1.5BA Cottage has been completely remodeled from the foundation up, making it essentially a newly constructed residence. Featuring a spacious layout, split heating/AC, bath with radiant floor heating, and a large outdoor area perfect for relaxation or entertaining. A large shed provides for additional storage. 152-154 Ord St is a premier address offering quick access to the Castro, nearby parks, transit options, and vibrant retail options. It offers the perfect mix of city convenience & quiet privacy. A rare opportunity to own a piece of history with strong income potential,"
  },
